If it writes a hundred scripts and you cannot tell which is good, what is the use?

156
00:08:54,833 --> 00:08:56,773
我们还在做一些设计
We also do some design work.

157
00:08:56,773 --> 00:09:00,933
就用GPT的Image Tool来出一些效果图
We use GPT's Image Tool to create concept visuals.

158
00:09:00,933 --> 00:09:04,093
甚至现在都可以出矢量图，都完全可以
It can even produce vector graphics now. It really can.

159
00:09:04,093 --> 00:09:06,353
设计这个东西，我都感觉快要被干掉了
As a designer, I feel like I am about to be replaced.

160
00:09:06,353 --> 00:09:08,373
我向前辈学习，我还是比较年轻
I am here to learn from the veterans. I am still quite young.

161
00:09:09,233 --> 00:09:12,000
我觉得最大的核心竞争力
I think the greatest core capability

162
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:14,773
就是你能组织到别人组织不到的资源，快速地变现
is organizing resources others cannot reach and monetizing them quickly.

163
00:09:15,153 --> 00:09:16,313
我觉得这就是超级个体
That, to me, is a super individual.

164
00:09:16,313 --> 00:09:21,053
所以这也是我不断去组织这个会议的一个初衷
That is also why I keep organizing these meetings.

165
00:09:21,053 --> 00:09:24,773
我会不断地每个月去组织不同的人、不同的资源进来
Every month, I will keep bringing in different people and resources.

166
00:09:24,773 --> 00:09:28,013
这样的话，我们团队会越来越大，团体会越强大
This way, our team will grow larger and stronger.

167
00:09:28,013 --> 00:09:30,333
因为我自身认为一件事情就是
One thing I firmly believe is this:

168
00:09:30,333 --> 00:09:33,793
当你跟就在同一个行业里面
when you work alongside others in the same field,

169
00:09:33,793 --> 00:09:36,193
然后一块去做的时候，大家都好的时候
and everyone around you is doing well,

170
00:09:36,193 --> 00:09:38,233
你自然不会差，自然不会差
you naturally will not fall behind. You will not fall behind.

171
00:09:38,233 --> 00:09:41,453
不是说你自己一个超级个体要做得多强、多牛逼
A super individual does not need to be exceptionally powerful alone.

172
00:09:41,893 --> 00:09:46,533
我觉得超级个体一定是要做到资源共享、资源整合
A super individual must share and integrate resources.

173
00:09:46,533 --> 00:09:49,173
有一个项目，大家有能力一块扑上去干
When a project comes, everyone with the right skills works on it together.

174
00:09:49,593 --> 00:09:51,533
然后做完之后大家散，对吧
When it is done, everyone moves on. Right?

175
00:09:51,533 --> 00:09:53,433
我觉得这是最牛逼的超级个体
To me, that is the most powerful kind of super individual.

176
00:09:53,433 --> 00:09:57,513
这也就是希望我们未来能够持续走下去
That is why I hope we can keep moving forward together.

177
00:09:57,513 --> 00:09:59,393
持续组织的这样的一个动力
It is what motivates us to keep organizing these events.

178
00:10:00,013 --> 00:10:03,573
这个也是我们的第一次，也是我的第一次
This is our first time, and it is my first time too.

179
00:10:03,573 --> 00:10:06,633
所以说，我觉得这个起点非常好
I think this is a very good starting point.

180
00:10:06,633 --> 00:10:10,733
我会坚持继续做下去，感谢大家的到来
I will keep doing this. Thank you all for coming.
